~ start
if not StoryFlags.met_jiles
	=> first_dialogue
else
	=> nothing_to_say

~ first_dialogue
Roadie: Hey, what's your name?
???: Huh? Oh-
Jiles: Jiles. Real estate developer, and pizza consumer. Currently a captive suspect...
Roadie: That's what I wanted to talk to you about. I'm on this murder case and need to ask some questions.
Jiles: I just got here! Don't skew this investigation pal.
Roadie: Gotta talk to everyone 'pal'
$> StoryFlags.met_jiles = true
=> END

~ nothing_to_say
Jiles: What now kid?
Roadie: Nothing, just wanted to check in
Jiles: Well, you've checked in. Just leave me to some peace until you have something to say
Roadie: Alright.
=> END